{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_slchan_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_slchan_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"新的高峰","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_slchan_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"f5af4bd8a1b3fdc657d59d56728470908388d04b1cfa09217d649a6fcd0ee56f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g20_skyblue_R1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿——咻，还差一步！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我跳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"着陆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这块岩壁还挺有挑战性的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里差不多已经到山腰了吧，先休息一会儿，然后向山顶攀登好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？那边是......烟？这种基本没有人会来的地方，还是大白天，怎么会有人生火？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，难道是求救信号？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，腿伤成这样，柴火也不好收集，这样的荒郊野岭，但愿会有猎人什么的路过看到吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还得小心别引来野兽......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别紧张，我是来附近登山的，看到这里有烟，猜是不是求救信号，就过来看一看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的有人来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的腿受伤了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，这里的山太陡峭了，我不小心摔了下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，为什么会有萨科塔在这里爬山？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是这样的，我是公证所的执行者，正在执行一名死者的遗嘱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遗嘱上提到要找到一位多年前离开拉特兰的萨科塔，而我一路调查，得知他就住在附近的山上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"于是我就想在附近找一找，结果......如你所见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们公证所也真是够辛苦的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，你知道公证所吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你应该听说过罗德岛吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛——啊，费德里科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你们也真是够辛苦的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，还好吧，我觉得送葬人挺有意思的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你别跟他一起出任务，那确实挺有意思的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，能麻烦你送我到山下的镇子里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要在那里休整一下，然后继续执行遗嘱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还要继续执行任务吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，来，扶住我的手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨科塔，还是来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，萨玛拉小姐，我以前就有些好奇了，公证所的人，感觉和我们罗德岛的干员差不多忙，整天要跑东跑西的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么要为离开的人做到这个地步呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为即使他们离开了拉特兰，律法也始终将我们联系在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"律法......就像《耶拉冈德》一样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《耶拉冈德》？啊，我早该看出来了，你来自谢拉格，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，对我们谢拉格人来说，是对耶拉冈德的信仰把我们联系在一起的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......其中或许有些微的不同，据我所知，耶拉冈德的信徒相信耶拉冈德在冥冥之中庇护着生活在谢拉格的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我们拉特兰人所信仰的，是律法本身，我们相信有一种规则把我们联系在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们对彼此负责，我们爱护彼此，我们理解彼此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以才会有公证所的诞生，因为我们愿意为同胞付出，也相信这是我们每个人的义务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶拉冈德的信徒彼此之间也会相互关照，不过我们的表达会更加含蓄，因为我们相信，耶拉冈德已经替我们安排好了一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，原来耶拉冈德的信徒是这样想的吗，真有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这还是我第一次真正接触耶拉冈德信仰，要是有时间，真想和你坐下来好好聊一聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我还有任务在身，谢谢你送我到这里，恩希亚小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我完成遗嘱之后有机会，我们再——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于这个遗嘱，你能详细给我说一说吗，说不定我能帮上忙呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这附近的山都很陡峭，要是不小心的话，说不定还会受伤的。我比较擅长登山，应该能帮上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然啦，要是是什么比较机密的事情就算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也并不是那么需要保密的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，会不会太麻烦你了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事没事，我的外派任务已经完成了，距离集合返回本舰还有一小段时间，现在可以自由活动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然我也不会来这里登山啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，那我就恭敬不如从命了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是这样的，我们有一位德高望重的铳骑，雷吉斯阁下，前阵子寿终正寝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他留下了遗嘱，希望公证所找到四十年前与他诀别，离开了拉特兰的弟弟，学者林吉斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诀别？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"由于年代久远，恐怕只有两位当事人知道具体情况了。我们知道的只有，他们当时因为对待战争的态度不同而产生了分歧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而教宗阁下当时更为偏向雷吉斯阁下的意见，最终林吉斯阁下选择了自我流放，远走他乡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷吉斯阁下知道只要有自己在，林吉斯阁下绝不会返回拉特兰，所以才希望在自己死后林吉斯阁下能返回拉特兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果林吉斯阁下也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于这一点，遗嘱上也有说明，他希望至少带回林吉斯阁下的信物，与他葬在一起，让他们能兄弟团聚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让曾经分道扬镳的兄弟团聚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然这样，我就更要帮忙了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么更加具体的线索吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我之前打听过，这附近的人都和林吉斯阁下不是很熟，只有一个叫蒂亚娜的猎人似乎和他有过接触。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我并没有找到这个人，所以才会去附近的山头碰碰运气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个猎人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......这样就可以解释了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声）你受伤了所以没有察觉到也很正常，我们一路上都在被人跟踪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声）什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声）我还以为是盯上我们的强盗，现在看来......很可能就是你说的那个猎人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声）低头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在这里等我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去追！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的信号......和附近的移动城市可以连通吗，太好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我，执行者萨玛拉，请求援助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公证所执行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，枢机？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爬上山了，好敏捷的身手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不过，要比爬山，我可不会输！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，站住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是蒂亚娜，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是个路过的猎人罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别装啦，如果你只是路过，怎么会跟我们这么久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你肯定是从一开始就知道萨玛拉小姐是来干什么的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，你是萨卡兹？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是又怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹怎么会——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身手还不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，是你的准头不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（等等，她不是在瞄准我。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（难道说——！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶，好疼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好深的陷阱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"从一开始就在把我往陷阱上引吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不止，我看你还挺擅长爬山的，顺便把你的登山装备也给卸了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萨卡兹猎人探出头，向崖心挥了挥她随身携带的背包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么时候！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，我没打算杀了你。等会儿我就去镇里告诉自卫队，说有人在山上遇到危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的背包之类的我也会寄存在那，等救援的人来了，拿回你的东西就滚吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么要这么做？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的要求很简单，姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去告诉公证所的人，林吉斯不会回拉特兰的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，要是我多留个心眼就好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦......这个笼子还有尖刺......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，这里原本应该是一个捕兽陷阱，偷猎者最喜欢布置这样的陷阱等猎物自己送上门来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是这里面的尖刺都被拆掉了，她刚才也说，她没打算害死我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些应该是她拆掉的吧，用来应对今天这种可能发生的情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是这样的话......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个菲林看起来还挺结实，困在那里一时半会儿应该死不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赶紧去把老头子的东西收拾收拾，然后跟镇里报信吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，真是麻烦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陷阱里残留的那些机关足够作为支点让我爬上来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个距离，你的弩比不过我的钩爪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想要见林吉斯阁下一面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不会见你的，滚回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就别怪我不客气了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，当心，那边的岩石很不稳固！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓住我的钩爪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"松开，你撑不住的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能抛下你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶，既然拉不上来的话......准备好接受冲击！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你应该松开我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有打算杀了我，我当然也不想看着你送死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有这么算的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚才说萨卡兹没有那个意思，我只是有些惊讶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不怪你，任何人听到都会惊讶的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该知道他有个哥哥——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷吉斯，现在他哥哥死了，想让他回拉特兰，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不会回去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都几十年过去了，现在才想起来找他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，这毕竟是雷吉斯阁下最后的心愿——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且亲人之间，就算有再深的隔阂，也一定有化解的办法的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你凭什么这么觉得？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的哥哥姐姐，因为一些事情关系也不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但、但是，他们终究是兄妹，他们之间，只是缺少了一个能够让彼此敞开心扉谈一谈的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己都说得不那么肯定，还想说服我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为要是连我都放弃这么想了，那我们一家人，就真的再也没法坐在一起了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我是知道的，哥哥和姐姐心里一直想着对方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你再怎么努力也没用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林吉斯他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早就死了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，灰尘好多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他死后，我就没有再来过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道我的父母是谁，是镇子里一个乞丐把我养大的，算是我爸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"镇里的人不坏，但没人愿意收养一个萨卡兹，等我爸死了，我就开始靠打猎为生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一次在山里遇到个大家伙，本来以为自己要死了，结果一个路过的萨科塔老头救了我一命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他把肉分了我一些，还说我的箭术臭得像坨屎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实......我到现在都记得，他把我救下来后，看着我愣了一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一开始不明白是为什么，很久以后我才知道，他看出了我是萨卡兹，他那时就想杀了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我只是个在乡下长大的野孩子，我那时可不知道这些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，就算现在我也不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打我生下来我就没见过萨科塔，我也不明白为什么要去恨这些头顶光环的家伙，镇子上的老爷们要讨人厌多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......历史总是很复杂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看不出来你还挺有学问的，和臭老头说了一样的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就当作你在夸我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正，我觉得他挺厉害，就想让他教我箭术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他并不想让我靠近他，每次我想靠近，他都会用铳把我赶走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在想来也是有点好笑，我不知道他动了几次杀心，但那时的我不明白，甚至以为他在逗我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果到最后，他大概也是烦了，我们形成了一种默契，我到他家附近躲着，他会故意露两手给我看，算是教我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三年前，附近来了一伙萨卡兹盗匪，他们看到我是萨卡兹，身手也不错，就想要笼络我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拒绝了他们，他们就把我绑架了，想要逼我就范。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果臭老头一个人跑来救我，最后，我活了下来，他却——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多年，他从没认过我这个学生，我想，他应该根本不愿意认一个萨卡兹当学生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但没有他教我的本领，我早就死在这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，他从没离开过这里，也没有人来找过他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在他的兄弟想要让他回拉特兰？哪怕是他的遗物，我也不同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不属于拉特兰，他属于这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你能理解的话，就放弃吧，否则的话，我不介意在这里把你解决掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以在屋子里到处看看吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......随便。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些书籍是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老头子还挺喜欢读书的，这些书都是他自己找来的，本来想教我，看我实在读不进去，就放弃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些书......都是有关萨卡兹和萨科塔的历史——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上面还有很详细的批注......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？这里有一张纸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一封......信？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷吉斯，正因为我们是至亲的兄弟，我们之间才无法因为共感而达成让步，因为这意味着对彼此的侮辱。\n只是，现在回想起来，当时我是不是有更好的做法，而不是一走了之？我想，或许是有的。\n但我们应该都不后悔彼此做出的选择。\n而且我们做出了选择，也不意味着另一个选择就永远失去了价值。\n我正是为此而选择离开拉特兰的。\n我想，我此生应该不会返回拉特兰了。\n但我会怀念你做的草莓奶昔的。\n——林吉斯"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亚娜小姐，你看这个。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林吉斯......并不恨雷吉斯，也不恨拉特兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他只是做出了选择，并且为了自己的选择而不再返回拉特兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那又怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎么样，他不还是没打算回拉特兰吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这和回不回拉特兰没有关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们兄弟之间并没有隔阂，就是这么简单的事，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"许多人在知道萨科塔可以依靠共感来共享情绪之后，会下意识地以为萨科塔之间不存在矛盾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事实上绝不是这样的，共享情绪只是能够让你得知对方是出于怎样的心情提出想法的，这并不意味着你就要理解并同意对方的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，在一些小事上，萨科塔之间是可以通过共感来达成和解或者让步的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，在一些重大事务上，萨科塔之间也有无法退让的界线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这些事务上，萨科塔之间最终能够达成的共识是“彼此之间无法互相理解”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是谁？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教皇厅枢机，薇尔丽芙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"枢机？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铳骑雷吉斯是我十分尊敬的长辈。我正好在拜访附近的城市，听说他的遗嘱在执行上遇到困难，自然要过来看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本我都打算直接出手了，没想到有人帮我解决了这样一桩麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必过分紧张，我在门外稍微听了一会二位的交谈，看起来事情已经解决了，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁告诉你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铳骑雷吉斯与他的弟弟学者林吉斯之间的分歧，出在对待战争的态度上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"薇尔丽芙抬起手，将黑洞洞的铳口对准了萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......混账。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别以为你可以为所欲为，萨科塔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"蒂亚娜也不甘示弱地举起弩，对准了萨科塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对于战争，雷吉斯阁下与教宗阁下选择了更加温和的态度，而林吉斯阁下则抱持较为主动和激进的观点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这导致了两人最后分道扬镳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷吉斯阁下的遗嘱中要求，如果林吉斯阁下已经死亡，那么需要将他的信物带回拉特兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾，信物里并不包括一个萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是一个普通的登山家能够插足的事，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以请罗德岛收留她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我没记错的话，罗德岛的原则是不主动插足国家事务——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然很难评价这条原则被执行的程度，但是，这趟浑水我想他们应该是不愿意蹚的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我可以让她去......去谢拉格！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？谢拉格？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亚小姐，您要想清楚，在这里使用您的姓氏，希瓦艾什，会带来什么影响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您从一开始就知道我是谁，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不否认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然您知道我的姓氏，想必也知道我的哥哥姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蔓珠院圣女恩雅，喀兰贸易总裁恩希欧迪斯，这两个名字，如今已经越来越为人所知了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在我心里，他们始终只是我的哥哥姐姐，是因为哥哥的选择，十年来没有再私下一起吃过一顿饭的兄妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我心里多多少少也明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像这对兄弟一样，哥哥和姐姐之间并不是不能互相理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恰恰相反，他们理解对方不会放弃自己的坚持，理解彼此的立场，理解有些事只有对方才能做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以他们是不可能回到从前的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白，但我就是没办法放弃这个想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而就在刚才，我得知了有一对萨科塔兄弟，他们也面临着相似的处境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们理解着彼此的无法理解，他们选择了分道扬镳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在生命的最后一刻，他们的心中依然想着彼此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这确实很感人，但是这对于阻止我的意义是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥哥和姐姐之间的互相理解，并不只是单纯地去包容对方的行为，更重要的是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们相信，对方的选择之中是有正确之处的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"并且相信，自己的选择终究能够影响对方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最重要的是——他们会抵达同一个终点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说得真好，恩希亚小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"薇尔丽芙说着，放下了手中的铳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本我也只是打算吓你两下的，把你逼走，然后任你逃命。毕竟，在原则上，我无法对出现在我视线中的萨卡兹放任不管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然恩希亚小姐提出了更好的方案，那我自然愿意遵从。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得我一定打不过你，而你从一开始就打算饶我一命？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己也这么想，不是吗？虽然这很困难，但请把这理解为一种善意，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混账萨科塔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正如恩希亚小姐所说，雷吉斯阁下并不认为林吉斯阁下是错误的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是在任何一个时代，对错都不会是决定一件事的唯一因素罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，我不会带走这里的所有东西，只需要一些纪念物，比如一本书，一些手稿就好，这样你可以接受吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，随你的便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，你的真诚十分动人，恩希亚小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的话让我确信了一件事，虽然我们身处不同的信仰之中，虽然我们的生活环境并不相同，但我们面临的问题始终是有共通之处的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，我也这么想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直以为萨科塔都是像能天使那样的性格，现在我知道了，萨科塔之间也会有各种各样的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，能够理解这一点，将会是你真正理解拉特兰的第一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，如果我没记错的话，谢拉格花费三年建造的耶拉冈德像即将落成，你应当要启程返回谢拉格参加落成典礼了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你愿意的话，我可以送你一程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于这一点，我有一个不情之请。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想跟着萨玛拉小姐四处走走，多了解一些拉特兰和萨科塔的事情，可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？你不打算回去了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暂时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"经过这次的事，我算是彻底想通了，想着把他们拉在一起确实没有意义了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定在我不在的时候，他们早就已经在一张桌子上吃过饭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然他们是能够互相理解的，既然他们心里都是装着谢拉格的，既然他们最终会殊途同归......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我也应该往前看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"枢机姐姐，你其实是为了我而来的，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没错，从萨玛拉告诉我你的名字，以及你和她聊的话题后，我就打算亲自来一趟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然在万国峰会打过照面了，谢拉格与拉特兰已经建立了联系，但耶拉冈德信仰与拉特兰教之间始终缺乏一个对话的契机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，就让我来成为这个契机吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，文化上的交流，这是谢拉格现在非常需要的东西。而对教宗阁下而言，这同样也是令人欢迎的对话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我必须最后问你一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亚·希瓦艾什阁下，您清楚自己在做什么，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，我代表拉特兰欢迎你，恩希亚小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不过在那之前，我需要先去附近的罗德岛办事处一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亚娜的去处得请他们帮我安排，还要请博士给老哥带个口信。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
